    "npcKind": "monster",
    "npcNotes": "<p><strong>Movement:</strong> 4 yards</p><p><strong>Death Grip.</strong> When damage equals or exceeds its Health, it removes half that damage, takes –1D on all tests and may then make two attacks a round as a Lesser Action.</p><p><strong>Vulnerable to Fire.</strong> Fire attacks gain an extra degree; fire damage equal to its Health destroys it.</p><p><strong>Mindless.</strong> Automatically fails Animal Handling, Deception, Healing, Knowledge, Persuasion, Status, Survival, Thievery, Warfare and Will tests.</p><p><strong>Making unfallen.</strong> Remove specialties, Destiny Points and benefits; Agility and Fighting –1, Athletics and Endurance +1, Cunning 1, Language 0. Claws and teeth deal Athletics damage (with Grab for humans).</p><p><em>Statistics: Agility 1, Athletics 3, Cunning 1, Endurance 3, Fighting 2, Language 0, Stealth 4. Sword Chronicle p. 191.</em></p>",
    "source": "Sword Chronicle p. 191"
  },
